# Test of Sagittarius (Q224), a second class-change test for rogues, elven scouts and assassins,
# played by a level 39 Assassin who already holds most of each rune count (the kills below bring
# each to ten), every script roll pinned to 1 (every drop lands, no Leto lizardman's blood calls
# Kadesh): Bernard starts it and pays the level 39 set's Dimensional Diamonds; Hamil reads
# Bernard's introduction and sends the traveller to Sir Aron Tanford; ten hunter runes of the ants
# for Hamil's second letter; Vokian sends it to the Breka orcs, whose tenth rune brings the
# talisman of the snake; Vokian takes the talisman; Hamil's third letter for Gauen; the four parts
# of the bow (stakato chitin, reinforced bowstring, mithril clip, manashen horn) for Gauen's
# Crescent Moon bow; Hamil sends it to the Leto lizardmen, whose kills give their blood; then
# relog. Kadesh and the finish are q224_test_of_sagittarius_kadesh. Expectations replay the
# reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q224_test_of_sagittarius.golden
character Sagittarius 39
class 35
random always 1
hold 3298 8
hold 3299 8
script quest.Q224_TestOfSagittarius
